== Ruihan Xu



~~~
{}{img_left}{photos/bio.png}{alt text}{312}{230}

I am a student in Physical Science Division (PSD) of the university of chicago. I received my bachelor's degree in Mathematics and Applied Mathematics from Shanghai Jiao Tong university in 2024.  \n
My current research interests primarily include sampling (this broadly includes randomized algorithms on graphs, MCMC, and many sampling algorithms), machine learning (this includes LLM and many other learning theories) and a range of related topics in applied mathematics.
